&lt;li&gt;🧘&amp;nbsp; Wellness allowance to support your mental and physical well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤝&amp;nbsp; Great startup culture — remote but close-knit, with regular retreats and social events to stay connected.&lt;/li&gt;
